WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:35.100
Jerid's Desperate Attack

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.160
Don't you think the A.E.U.G.'s
focusing too much on defense lately?

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:08.500
Aggressive tactics will reinforce the
false perception of the A.E.U.G. as terrorists.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.900
You're aware why Axis has begun
its move, aren't you, Lieutenant?

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:14.140
No.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.840
I don't believe a man formerly with Zeon
wouldn't know why!

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.470
Mr. Wong.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:19.910
He's here.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.350
Come in!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.360
Are you saying that Axis, the asteroid base
that Zeon remnants use...

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.360
...has arrived in the Earth Sphere?

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.190
Yes.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.200
So the lieutenant intends
to make contact with them...

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:39.240
...and have them ally with the A.E.U.G.?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.200
Yes.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:41.570
Is it possible?

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:44.410
If we can use the Argama in the process.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:47.310
I'll get them to come!

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:52.240
Lieutenant Quattro,
what are your true feelings about this?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:58.280
Do you believe remnants loyal to Mineva,
a survivor of the Zabi Family...

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.910
...have honorable intentions?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:06.050
Talking couldn't hurt.
It would be worth a try.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:07.400
Yes.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.270
Yazan team, taking off!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.480
<i>Your course is clear! Go ahead!</i>

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.280
I already know that!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.830
Why have we been taken off
this latest operation?!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.330
I haven't taken you off.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:46.460
I want you two to take separate actions
from the rest.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:47.830
Captain!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.270
I want you two to standby
in this abandoned colony.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:56.940
The Argama will surely escape to this area
to avoid anti-air firing from our fleet.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.510
And you'll ambush them there.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.650
Will it be that simple?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.650
Sure it will.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.210
If I was the Argama's captain,
that's what I would do.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.690
So Yazan's team is a decoy?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.520
That's right.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.960
Unless we keep him in the dark...

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.430
...he wouldn't agree to it,
would he?

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:17.330
Once we sink the Argama,
the Zeta Gundam's pilot will be shaken.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.340
That would be your chance
to destroy the Zeta.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:20.600
Very well.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.760
I'll sink the Argama together
with the Zeta Gundam.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:24.600
That's the spirit.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.640
I'm counting on you, Lieutenant Jerid.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:29.000
And you too, Ensign Mouar.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.680
Nothing I say will make
any difference, will it?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.910
I've become a man who cannot move
a step forward before defeating Kamille.

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.950
To me, he's a wall blocking my way.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.990
Isn't it dangerous to be
obsessed like that?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.060
Mouar.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.930
Remember, Jerid.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.870
I'll always be there behind you.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.240
What?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.940
You're fast, Mouar.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.050
Ensign Mouar Pharaoh, taking off!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.050
Lieutenant Jerid Messa, taking off!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.080
Fa! Let's play!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.550
You shouldn't be here!

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.060
Come on, Fa!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.060
You'll be scolded by Mr. Astonaige!

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.720
Fa! Get mad! Fa!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.230
Nobody will play with us!

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.930
- Why not play with them?
- I don't want to spoil them!

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.800
But a war could break out any time.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.930
I must give priority to my duties as a pilot.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.140
Leave the piloting to me.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.610
<i>Kamille! Fa!</i>

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.410
<i>Come up here at once!</i>

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.380
Captain Bright?!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.620
Don't you realize
that this isn't a daycare center?!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.520
I'm terribly sorry.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:16.880
But, Captain...!

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.440
Don't talk back to me!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.050
Just do as I say!

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:20.820
I understand, sir.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.680
Bright! Mad! Mad!

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.190
Bright, mad!

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.860
Bright! Mad!

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.260
Get back to work.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.460
Bright! Mad!

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.870
Those children think of Captain Bright
as a playmate!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.540
Kamille, wait!

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.950
Listen, we'll wait
until the last possible moment.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.420
In a surprise attack,
everything depends on the first assault.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:51.580
I know.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:52.620
Mouar?

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:53.660
Yes?

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.560
Don't try too hard.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.690
There's no need to worry about me.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.160
Thank you, Jerid.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.510
We're entering the battle zone.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.810
- All units, don't fall behind.
- <i>Roger!</i>

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:21.980
That Jerid...!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.450
Isn't he in bed sulking about
being omitted from the team?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.460
I expected him to have a bit more guts.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.300
There it is! It hasn't retreated.
I respect that.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.630
Enemy mobile suits approaching!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.190
Ten degrees above on portside!

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.870
The number: ten! No, twenty?!

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.710
Portside gunners, get ready to fire!
Everyone, fire back at will!

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.870
All units, take level one battle stations!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.000
Zeta Gundam, let's do it!

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:21.470
Nemo, taking off!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.690
They've sent out mobile suits, so there
won't be any anti-air fire from them.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.230
- <i>Shall we turn back?</i>
- Are you crazy?! We'll proceed forward!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.420
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:52.010
Survivors from the last time?
Is Lieutenant Jerid among them?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:56.840
Kamille, aren't they acting
strangely?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.280
Yes, it's as if they're waiting
for us to make a move.

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:06.660
Enemy approaching
from 45 degrees below, portside!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.660
What?!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:10.520
From below this time?! Observation unit,
where are you looking?!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.460
All vessels, open anti-air fire!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.030
Don't hold back! Keep firing!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.650
Second wave coming!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.310
Keep our distance from the Radish!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.780
Lieutenant Emma!
I see firing lines behind us!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.230
<i>Is it a separate enemy squadron?!</i>

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.760
I'll return!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.000
Kamille!

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.530
Fa! You have no need to go!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.830
Lieutenant Apolly!

00:09:58.310 --> 00:09:59.670
They're here!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:03.570
We're heading right in!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.210
Is what Gady said
really going to happen?

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.750
We'll move into the abandoned colony
ahead of us!

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.880
- But...!
- It'll be the perfect place to regroup.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:50.120
Roger.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:52.530
We've sent out
every one of our mobile suits.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:54.860
I've played right into the hands
of the enemy.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.260
How careless of me!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:08.810
<i>Jerid!</i>

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.400
Yeah, Gady's a genius.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.850
- Let's go!
- See you later!

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.090
Yeah, later.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.700
You're finished, Argama!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.270
Captain! Enemy mobile suits!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:38.440
What?!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.940
Anti-air battery, fire!
They're firing!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:50.810
Call back our mobile suits!
Fore barrage is weak!

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:54.180
<i>Microwave receiving panel damaged!</i>
<i>Get more fire extinguishing fluid!</i>

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:55.660
<i>Living quarters hit!</i>

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.160
<i>Section of the left catapult deck damaged!</i>

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.660
What are the gunners doing?!

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.150
- The Argama's being bombarded!
- Proceed forward!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:22.450
Gunners, our barrage is weak!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.950
A powerful mobile suit
is coming at us from fore!

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.500
The Argama's...!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:40.900
Someone's approaching!

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.270
How dare you!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.240
You've come to get in my
way again...

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:55.940
Jerid?!

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:58.350
- ...but all the luck's with me!
- Shut up!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.600
Jerid?!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:08.930
The Mk. II?!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.990
Why can't Yazan
keep the enemies occupied!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.440
It's Emma's unit! Emma has returned!

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.700
What about the other mobile suits?!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.880
- Hurry with the extinguishing fluid!
- Out of the way!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.270
This isn't enough!

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.110
- We also need scramble balloons!
- Yes, sir!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.520
- Is the oxygen supply device all right?!
- Y-Yes?!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.180
Check it out at once!

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.290
As I said, luck is favoring me!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.560
Not yet!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:02.580
He's like a different person!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.910
Is this really that same Lieutenant Jerid?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.290
What was that?!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.090
Those children!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:18.360
Fa, join me!
We must protect the bridge!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.900
Argama, you're as good as dead!

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.500
Where are you guys looking?!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.240
- <i>I'm worried about the children!</i>
- <i>Fa!</i>

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.870
<i>There's still smoke in the living quarters!</i>

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:33.440
Has the fire been extinguished
in the portside living quarters?!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.280
Put out the fire from the outside as well!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.850
That mobile suit!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.320
Fa! Hurry!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:47.260
Haro?!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.300
The Argama's in trouble!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.440
Can't wait until things are
getting worse.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.050
Kamille!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:13.720
There's another one!

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.120
Fall!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:25.330
There's no getting away!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.660
Jerid!

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.670
Fa's Nemo!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.840
Radish! Cover for the Argama's portside!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.110
If it's hit again,
the living quarters will be gone!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:37.980
<i>Roger that!</i>

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.350
Shinta! Qum!

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.080
Oh, Fa!

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.750
There's nothing to worry about!

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.690
We'll escape together!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.090
Watch out! Don't go that way!

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:56.360
What?

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:03.970
What the hell?!

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:10.710
There!

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.540
- <i>Kamille! Above you!</i>
- What?!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.270
Kamille!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.320
Jerid?!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:23.390
Damn!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.600
Mouar?!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.000
Zeta!

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:33.000
Y-You're using yourself as a shield?!

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.170
H-Hey! Mouar!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.000
I said I'll be there to protect you, Jerid...!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:44.850
Mouar!!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.180
Kamille!! Bastard!!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.290
Wh-What's this? This sensation?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.090
I heard Mouar... Mouar?!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.370
Why do you have to always...?!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.600
I don't want to die yet either!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.770
<i>Jerid... Jerid.</i>

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:42.630
Where am I?
Have I died?

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.460
Mouar!

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.810
<i>Jerid, you will never lose.</i>

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:30.850
<i>Because you are the one able to guide</i>
<i>this world in the proper direction.</i>

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.990
That doesn't really matter!

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:35.790
I only... want to grasp everything
with my own hands!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.120
<i>To survive.</i>

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.450
<i>To fight.</i>

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:40.590
<i>That is the correct path for you.</i>

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.260
But if so...

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.460
...then why do you also have to leave me?!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.190
M-My arm.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:50.540
It's numb!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.140
Mouar!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.450
Okay, Mouar! I can do it!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:21.670
What?! Can he still fight?!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.480
What in the...?!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:35.280
- It's headed straight for us!
- Captain!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:36.940
We'll leave it to Kamille and Emma!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.130
Emma!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.030
He's still coming?!

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.390
The guy's gone berserk!

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.930
I know!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.800
M-Mouar!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.610
I-I can't do it!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.390
We're retreating, Gady?!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.500
How could he have lasted for so long?

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.270
Jerid... Messa...!

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:33.300
Fa! Wake up, Fa!

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:34.880
Fa!

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.430
Hey, there they are! This way!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.990
Mouar?

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.320
Where are you?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.320
H-Hey!

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:08.740
Lieutenant Emma.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.300
Excellent job in
protecting the Argama.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:14.340
I couldn't have done it if it wasn't for
Kamille keeping the enemy occupied.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.680
Lieutenant.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:20.510
Oh, and please don't be too hard
on Fa Yuiry.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.460
Lieutenant Emma.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:26.430
But Petty Officer Fa disobeyed
orders during a battle.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:31.660
I don't believe we can solve this
problem just by "correcting" her.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:36.030
Then she doesn't have what it takes
to be a pilot?

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.260
Is that what you're getting at?

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:40.710
That decision is up to you, Captain Bright.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:43.380
Fa.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:47.940
Good job in saving the children.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.420
I personally thank you.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:54.390
Also for keeping the damage
to the living quarters to a minimum.

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:56.050
Captain Bright.

00:21:57.530 --> 00:21:59.890
Th-Thank you.

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:01.800
Fa!

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:04.460
You look well! I'm glad!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.430
It's because you were here with us.

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.830
Thank you, Fa.

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:21.410
But... I know what I saw...!

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:31.050
Those who are dead don't shed tears.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:48.560
On Scirocco's orders...

00:23:48.640 --> 00:23:51.610
...Sarah Zabiarov sneaks into
Von Braun City on a secret mission.

00:23:52.620 --> 00:23:55.730
The tricks of fate cause Kamille
and Sarah to meet once again.

00:23:56.190 --> 00:24:01.270
In the meantime, the clock on a time bomb
ticks toward disaster, close to the Argama.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:06.450
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Half Moon Love".

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:10.060
You will see the tears of time.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Half Moon Love
